pe located at a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single geographical coordinate. Depending on how it is used, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation"},{"type":"text","text":" object is known as a point annotation or point shape. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, you could use a point shape to represent a city at low zoom levels, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"address at high zoom levels, or the location of a long press gesture."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNPointAnnotation","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOverlay":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOverlay","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol defines a specific type of annotation that represents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"both a point and an area on a map. Overlay objects are essentially data objects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that contain the geographic data needed to represent the map area. Overlays can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"take the form of a polyline or polygon."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNOverlay","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNOverlay","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOverlay","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnoverlay","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPolygon":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon"},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a shape consisting of one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"polygons that do not overlap. For example, you could use a multipolygon shape"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to represent the body of land that consists of an island surrounded by an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"atoll: the inner island would be one "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon"},{"type":"text","text":" object, while the surrounding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"atoll would be another. You could also use a multipolygon shape to represent a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"group of disconnected but related buildings."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPolygon","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNMultiPolygon","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPolygon":{"title":"MLNPolygon","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolygon","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon"},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a closed shape consisting of four or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices, specified as "},{"code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instances, and the edges that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connect them. For example, you could use a polygon shape to represent a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"building, a lake, or an area you want to highlight."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNPolygon","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"role":"article","title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"title":"MLNShape","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShape","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the content that forms the base map.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeCollectionFeature":{"role":"symbol","title":"MLNShapeCollectionFeature","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object associates a shape collection with an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"optional identifier and attributes."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapecollectionfeature","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeCollectionFeature","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView/addAnnotations:":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Adds an array of annotations to the map view.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addAnnotations:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"addAnnotations:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/addAnnotations:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/addannotations:","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNEmptyFeature":{"role":"symbol","title":"MLNEmptyFeature","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNEmptyFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" object associates an empty shape with an optional"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier and attributes."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNEmptyFeature","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnemptyfeature","fragments":[{"text":"MLNEmptyFeature","kind":"identifier"}]}}}